#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:1
msgid "Nexus 文档内容与图示标准"
msgstr "Nexus documentation content and diagram standards"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:3
msgid ""
"本标准用于新增和修改的平台文档。目标是让读者明确任务、条件、操作和结果， 能够沿文档完成使用、接入、维护或验收。既有页面按 "
"{download}`实施台账 <documentation-system-execution.csv>`逐批审查；本标准的存在不表示 "
"正文迁移、图册、自动检查、翻译或发布已经完成。"
msgstr ""
"These standards govern new/changed platform documentation so readers "
"understand tasks, conditions, actions and results for use, integration, "
"maintenance or acceptance. Review existing pages in batches using the "
"{download}`implementation ledger <documentation-system-execution.csv>`. "
"These standards do not establish completion of content migration, diagrams, "
"automation, translation or publication."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:8
msgid ""
"必须/不得表示合同要求；应/不应表示默认做法，例外需有理由；可以表示允许的 选择。规范性要求必须明确主体、条件、动作和可检查的结果。责任由 Codex "
"承担， 独立 agent 进行内容和图示评审，不要求虚构人员账号。"
msgstr ""
"Must/must not express requirements; should/should not express defaults with "
"justified exceptions; may expresses permitted choices. Normative rules must "
"identify actors, conditions, actions and checkable outcomes. Codex owns "
"responsibility; independent agents review content/diagrams without invented "
"human accounts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:12
msgid "1. 内容必须帮助读者完成任务"
msgstr "1. Content must help readers complete tasks"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "编号"
msgstr "ID"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "约束"
msgstr "Constraint"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "验收方法"
msgstr "Acceptance method"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-01"
msgstr "TXT-01"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "开头说明读者能完成什么、适用配置和必要限制"
msgstr ""
"Open with outcomes, applicable configuration and essential limitations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "单看开头能够判断是否适用"
msgstr "Readers can determine applicability from the opening alone."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-02"
msgstr "TXT-02"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "tutorial/how-to 围绕一个主要目标，先给结果和必要步骤"
msgstr ""
"Tutorials/how-to guides focus on one primary goal, giving outcomes and "
"necessary steps first."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "独立读者能够按步骤完成"
msgstr "Independent readers can complete the steps."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-03"
msgstr "TXT-03"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "一段围绕一个问题，使用具体主体、主动动词和稳定术语"
msgstr ""
"One paragraph addresses one question with concrete actors, active verbs and "
"consistent terms."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "去掉重复结论、口号和无解释的缩写"
msgstr "Remove repeated conclusions, slogans and unexplained abbreviations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-04"
msgstr "TXT-04"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "比较/字段用表；顺序用步骤；结构与并发用对应图"
msgstr ""
"Use tables for comparisons/fields, steps for order, and appropriate diagrams"
" for structure/concurrency."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "表、图、正文各自承担必要信息"
msgstr "Tables, diagrams and prose each carry necessary information."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-05"
msgstr "TXT-05"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "原始日志、大量hash和失败尝试链接到证据，不打断操作主线"
msgstr ""
"Link raw logs, long hashes and failed attempts as evidence without "
"interrupting main procedures."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "可读摘要能定位完整原件"
msgstr "Readable summaries locate complete originals."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-06"
msgstr "TXT-06"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "精确区分当前实现、已验证、估计和计划"
msgstr ""
"Separate current implementation, validation, estimates and plans precisely."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "每个能力/性能结论有范围与出处"
msgstr "Every capability/performance claim has scope and provenance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-07"
msgstr "TXT-07"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "同一规范只维护一份，概述/翻译/图链接权威合同"
msgstr ""
"Maintain one authoritative standard; summaries/translations/diagrams link "
"it."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "修改接口不需同步两份手写声明"
msgstr ""
"Interface changes do not require two handwritten declarations to be "
"synchronized."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "TXT-08"
msgstr "TXT-08"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "架构和合同改变同时核对受影响图、示例与翻译"
msgstr ""
"Architecture/contract changes review affected diagrams, examples and "
"translations together."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "PR列出影响范围与审查结果"
msgstr "PRs report impacts and review results."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:25
msgid ""
"不设机械字数、句数或图数量门槛。复杂页面需要任务索引和分层说明；简单动作 不强制配图。不能用“极致、完整、全部支持”等无范围结论代替成本和资格记录。"
msgstr ""
"Set no mechanical word, sentence or diagram quotas. Complex pages need task "
"indexes and layered explanations; simple actions need not have diagrams. "
"Unscoped “ultimate”, “complete” or “all supported” claims do not replace "
"cost/qualification records."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:28
msgid ""
"页面采用 [五类内容模板](documentation-templates.md)。模板规定必须回答的问题， "
"不强制所有页面使用相同标题。当前架构解释需回答：为何分层、谁拥有状态和资源、 谁调用谁、构建与运行各做什么、合法上下文、失败责任、成本及验证边界。"
msgstr ""
"Use the [five page templates](documentation-templates.md). They define "
"required questions without forcing identical headings. Architecture "
"explanations must address why layers exist, state/resource ownership, calls,"
" build/runtime responsibilities, legal context, failure responsibility, cost"
" and validation boundaries."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:32
msgid "2. 术语、单位和约束"
msgstr "2. Terminology, units and constraints"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:34
msgid ""
"首次出现可给中英文对应，随后同一概念使用同一词。C符号、配置键、错误码、 "
"结构字段及CSV/JSON中的机器身份值保持原样，包括状态、ID、摘要、路径、版本和 "
"配置值。原CSV/JSON权威字节不得由翻译覆盖；人类任务、说明和退出条件可以提供 译文或派生显示，并保留原文权威及证据身份。必须区分："
msgstr ""
"Introduce bilingual terms where useful, then use one term per concept. C "
"symbols, configuration keys, error codes, fields and machine identity values"
" in CSV/JSON stay unchanged, including states, IDs, digests, paths, versions"
" and configuration values. Translation must not overwrite authoritative "
"CSV/JSON bytes. Human-facing tasks, explanations and exit conditions may "
"have translations or derived displays while preserving original authority "
"and evidence identities. Distinguish:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "术语"
msgstr "Term"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "本文档体系中的含义"
msgstr "Meaning in these docs"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "factory"
msgstr "factory"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "返回该装配已有静态接口的typed查找"
msgstr "Typed lookup returning existing static interfaces of this assembly."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "face"
msgstr "face"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "公共只读接口，含ops和实例context"
msgstr "Public read-only interface containing ops and instance context."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "provider"
msgstr "provider"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "具体实现及私有状态"
msgstr "Concrete implementation and private state."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "controller/endpoint"
msgstr "controller/endpoint"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "控制器身份与其逻辑/外部端点身份"
msgstr "Controller identity versus logical/external endpoint identity."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "owner/executor"
msgstr "owner/executor"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "资源/生命周期责任与实际执行推进责任"
msgstr ""
"Resource/lifecycle responsibility versus actual execution/progression "
"responsibility."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "request/buffer"
msgstr "request/buffer"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "请求元数据与被借用的数据存储"
msgstr "Request metadata versus borrowed data storage."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "DMA complete"
msgstr "DMA complete"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "DMA阶段完成，尚需外设和引用排空"
msgstr "DMA phase complete; peripheral/reference drain remains."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "wire complete"
msgstr "wire complete"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "外设线上传输完成，尚需满足其余结束条件"
msgstr "Peripheral wire transfer complete; other final conditions remain."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "SETTLED"
msgstr "SETTLED"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "provider先排空必要引用，再以release发布SETTLED作为最后一次请求访问；调用方acquire观察"
msgstr ""
"The provider drains required references, then release-publishes SETTLED as "
"its final request access; the caller observes with acquire semantics."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "QUARANTINED"
msgstr "QUARANTINED"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "未安全结束，借用和恢复责任仍保留"
msgstr "Not safely ended; borrowing/recovery responsibility remains."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:50
msgid ""
"所有容量和测量写单位：B/KiB、Hz/MHz、cycles、µs/ms。Flash LOAD、Flash "
"footprint、预留RAM和实测栈高水位分别记录。对齐、长度粒度、inclusive limit、 "
"溢出、deadline时间域和最大配置须明确。理论上界、估计和实测值不能混写。"
msgstr ""
"State capacity/measurement units: B/KiB, Hz/MHz, cycles and µs/ms. Record "
"Flash LOAD, Flash footprint, reserved RAM and measured stack high-water "
"separately. Define alignment, length granularity, inclusive limits, "
"overflow, deadline domains and maximum configurations. Do not mix "
"theoretical bounds, estimates and measurements."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:54
msgid ""
"有效约束示例：ACCEPTED后，调用方必须保持请求和缓冲区有效，直到acquire观察 "
"SETTLED；复用相关adapter/observer存储还需对应引用排空。无效表述示例： “注意生命周期”。后者缺少主体、结束条件和失败责任。"
msgstr ""
"Valid rule: after ACCEPTED, callers retain requests/buffers until acquire-"
"observed SETTLED; reuse of adapter/observer storage also requires drained "
"references. Invalid wording: “mind the lifecycle”, which omits actors, final"
" conditions and failure responsibility."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:58
msgid "3. 事实、计划和资格必须分别表达"
msgstr "3. Separate facts, plans and qualification"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "表述"
msgstr "Claim"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "必需依据"
msgstr "Required basis"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "当前实现"
msgstr "Current implementation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "对应源码、配置/模式和行为范围"
msgstr "Corresponding source, configuration/mode and behavior scope."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "已通过模型/Native"
msgstr "Model/Native pass"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "精确源码、测试scope、实际执行结果"
msgstr "Exact source, test scope and actual execution."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "ARM链接/资源验证"
msgstr "ARM link/resource validation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "对应配置、工具、ELF/BIN/map与检查"
msgstr "Configuration, tools, ELF/BIN/maps and checks."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "软件候选"
msgstr "Software candidate"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "clean source、SDK、实际复现和同产物证据"
msgstr "Clean source, SDK, actual reproducibility and same-artifact evidence."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "实板通过"
msgstr "Physical pass"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "PCB/芯片/设备/station/image和实际测量"
msgstr "PCB/chip/equipment/station/image and actual measurements."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "计划或目标"
msgstr "Plan/target"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "未实施任务及退出条件，不写成现有能力"
msgstr ""
"Unimplemented tasks/exit conditions, never described as existing "
"capabilities."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:69
msgid ""
"芯片具备、SDK提供、provider维护、Board授权、软件通过、HIL通过不能合并成 "
"一个“支持”。当前、目标和参考配置必须在页面及图的caption中可见。文档发布 "
"不建立新的平台资格。旧结果保留原始源码、失败尝试和状态，不能重标为新HEAD。"
msgstr ""
"Chip features, SDK offerings, maintained providers, Board authorization, "
"software passes and HIL passes cannot collapse into one “supported” label. "
"Current/target/reference scope must be visible in pages and captions. Docs "
"establish no new platform qualification. Retain original source, failed "
"attempts and status; never relabel old results as current HEAD."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:73
msgid "4. 示例与命令"
msgstr "4. Examples and commands"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:75
msgid ""
"完整例子必须来自维护fixture或固定版本外部示例，并关联实际consumer验证。 "
"优先literalinclude；省略部分注明fragment原因。不能把示意片段称为完整教程。 "
"普通构建不自动刷写、不执行任意Markdown命令，也不取得远程latest。"
msgstr ""
"Complete examples must come from maintained fixtures or pinned external "
"examples and be associated with actual consumer validation. Prefer "
"literalinclude and explain fragments. Illustrations are not complete "
"tutorials. Ordinary builds do not automatically flash devices, execute "
"arbitrary Markdown commands or fetch remote latest."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:79
msgid ""
"每个命令说明工作目录、工具和连接前提、输入、预期结果、检查成功方法、清理。 固件C示例遵守现有C11、80列、四空格、附着大括号、类型侧指针和反斜杠 "
"Doxygen风格。工具及测试示例遵守对应语言规范，包括现有Python工具和C++17 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock用法。文档规则不重新定义仓库代码风格。"
msgstr ""
"Every command states working directory, tools/connections, inputs, expected "
"results, success checks and cleanup. Firmware C examples retain C11, 80 "
"columns, four spaces, attached braces, type-side pointers and backslash "
"Doxygen. Tool/test examples retain language conventions, including Python "
"and C++17 GoogleTest/GoogleMock. Docs do not redefine code style."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:84
msgid ""
"异步例子必须说明拒绝、接受借用、执行推进、等待、取消、排空及结束后资源。 "
"timeout/cancel不自动撤销借用；失败停止保留QUARANTINED存储。唤醒只是提示， "
"不能用无限等待掩盖推进条件。产品任务、私有分区和恢复政策仍属于外部工程。"
msgstr ""
"Async examples must explain rejection, accepted borrowing, progression, "
"waits, cancel, drain and final resources. Timeout/cancel does not revoke "
"borrows; failed stops retain QUARANTINED storage. Wakeups are hints, and "
"infinite waits cannot conceal progression conditions. Tasks, private "
"partitions and recovery stay external."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:88
msgid "5. 图示身份与关系"
msgstr "5. Diagram identity and relationships"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:90
msgid ""
"每张图至少有ID、名称、用途、类型、适用范围、关系图例、正文合同和来源。 "
"ID用于目录和迁移；公共anchor使用标准显式target/label，不能依靠front matter 自动产生引用。图源与输出登记在 "
"{download}`图册清单 <../assets/diagrams/diagram-index.csv>`。"
msgstr ""
"Every diagram must have at least an ID, name, purpose, type, scope, relation"
" legend, prose contract and source. IDs support indexes/migration; public "
"anchors use explicit targets/labels rather than automatic front-matter "
"references. Register pairs in the {download}`diagram index "
"<../assets/diagrams/diagram-index.csv>`."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "图的身份"
msgstr "Diagram identity"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "允许表达"
msgstr "Allowed meaning"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "不得暗示"
msgstr "Must not imply"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "current"
msgstr "current"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "经源码核对的结构/契约"
msgstr "Source-checked structure/contracts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
