msgstr "Automatic applicability to other platforms, PCBs or security domains."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:100
msgid ""
"一张图解决一个主要问题。分层图、编译依赖图、生成流程、数据流、时序和状态图 分别表达对应关系；混合关系时逐边标明含义。跨边界箭头必须可解释，不能同时 "
"把未标记箭头理解为调用、生成和所有权转移。"
msgstr ""
"One diagram answers one primary question. Layering, build dependencies, "
"generation, data, sequences and states have distinct relations; label each "
"edge when mixed. Explain cross-boundary arrows; unlabeled arrows cannot "
"simultaneously mean calls, generation and ownership transfers."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:104
msgid ""
"节点名对应源码、接口或明确概念；可选项必须有文字或线型标记，不能只靠颜色。 返回箭头、异步事件、状态迁移的方向准确。图不会因美化增加不存在的CPU "
"factory、 隐藏任务、统一池或强制OS层。"
msgstr ""
"Nodes name source, interfaces or explicit concepts. Mark optional elements "
"with text/line styles, not color alone. Returns, asynchronous events and "
"state transitions point correctly. Aesthetic changes must not invent CPU "
"factories, hidden tasks, unified pools or mandatory OS layers."

