msgstr "producer/block/consumer, overrun, stop/drain and service budgets."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:130
msgid ""
"运行图必须让读者看到：factory取得已有接口以后，日常I/O直接通过face进入 "
"provider；Arch按编译目标选择；应用拥有调度和执行进度。初始化顺序不能由静态 结构图推断，静态结构图也不能代表运行时每次调用路径。"
msgstr ""
"Runtime diagrams must show that after factory lookup, ordinary I/O calls "
"faces/providers directly; Arch is compile-target-selected; applications own "
"scheduling/progression. Static structure does not determine initialization "
"order or represent every runtime call."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:134
msgid ""
"状态图中REJECTED/ACCEPTED是admission结果，不伪造为nx_request_state_t状态。 "
"SETTLED只在全部必要引用排空后发布；取消/deadline不能直接指向“存储已释放”。 "
"QUARANTINED到结束必须有实际恢复/排空证明，不暗示每个provider都有恢复API。 "
"时序图必须包含相关失败分支或链接独立失败图，并标清Task/IRQ/DMA/安全域。"
msgstr ""
"REJECTED/ACCEPTED are admission outcomes, not invented nx_request_state_t "
"enum states. Publish SETTLED only after required reference drain; "
"cancel/deadlines never point directly to reclaimed storage. Ending "
"QUARANTINED needs actual recovery/drain proof without implying every "
"provider has recovery APIs. Sequence diagrams must include failure branches "
"or link separate failure diagrams, with Task/IRQ/DMA/security domains "
"marked."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:139
msgid "图不能替代正文的调用前提与权威合同。图文冲突时暂停相关交付结论并修正来源， 不能只改图或教程隐藏规范冲突。"
msgstr ""
"Diagrams do not replace preconditions/contracts. Conflicts suspend affected "
"delivery claims until sources are corrected; changing diagrams/tutorials "
"alone must not hide contract conflicts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:142
msgid "7. 图源、视觉和离线交付"
msgstr "7. Sources, visual quality and offline delivery"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:144
msgid ""
"首批采用可编辑Graphviz DOT和本地SVG，图源与输出成对保存。Sphinx后续可用 "
"内置graphviz扩展；新图链及工具锁仍按DOC-25/33实施。既有Mermaid作为迁移输入， "
"不能另维护同一图的第二份权威源。需要时序专用工具时，以实际需求另行审查闭包。"
msgstr ""
"Initially use editable Graphviz DOT and local SVG pairs. Sphinx may later "
"use its graphviz extension; new chains/locks follow DOC-25/33. Existing "
"Mermaid is migration input, not another authority for the same diagram. "
"Specialized sequence tools need independently reviewed closures justified by"
" real demand."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:148
msgid "每张图同时满足："
msgstr "Every diagram satisfies:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:150
msgid "图源可审查，图名/ID稳定；图源变更后重新生成输出。"
msgstr ""
"Reviewable source and stable names/IDs; regenerate after source changes."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:151
msgid "深色文字与清楚边界；颜色不是唯一含义，灰度下仍可区分。"
msgstr ""
"Dark text/clear boundaries; colors are not sole meaning and grayscale "
"remains distinguishable."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:152
msgid "标签短且具体，复杂说明放正文；过密时拆图，不缩小到无法阅读。"
msgstr ""
"Short specific labels with detailed prose; split dense diagrams rather than "
"shrinking unreadably."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:153
msgid "中文、英文、C符号完整，无缺字、重叠、裁切和模糊截图。"
msgstr ""
"Complete Chinese/English/C symbols without missing glyphs, overlap, clipping"
" or blurry screenshots."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:154
msgid "提供alt和caption；窄屏可以放大或独立打开SVG，不把整图强制缩成小字。"
msgstr ""
"Alt text/captions; narrow screens allow zoom/standalone SVG rather than "
"forcing tiny text."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:155
msgid "SVG默认无脚本、动画、foreignObject、外部href/资源及DOCTYPE。"
msgstr ""
"SVG defaults exclude scripts, animation, foreignObject, external "
"href/resources and DOCTYPE."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:156
msgid "图和图源随离线包交付，加载、字体说明与检查不依赖CDN。"
msgstr ""
"Offline packages include diagrams/sources; loading, font notes and checks "
"need no CDN."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:157
msgid "Graphviz及实际字体进入文档工具闭包，缺失或差异不伪称已验证。"
msgstr ""
"Graphviz/actual fonts belong to tool closure; missing/different tools never "
"claim validation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:159
msgid ""
"SVG解析和渲染成功不证明架构正确。独立审查必须逐边核对调用/依赖、状态和 失败责任。实际显示需要检查桌面、窄屏/放大和打印；未执行项保留未验证状态。"
msgstr ""
"Successful SVG parsing/rendering does not prove architecture correctness. "
"Independent review must check every call/dependency, state and failure edge."
" Actual display checks desktop, narrow/zoom and print; unexecuted checks "
"remain unverified."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:162
msgid "8. 评审与自动化职责"
msgstr "8. Review and automation responsibilities"

