#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "正常/失败/恢复和所有权正确"
msgstr "Correct success/failure/recovery and ownership."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "图"
msgstr "Diagrams"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "图源语法、文件配对、SVG资源、哈希"
msgstr "Source syntax, pairs, SVG resources and hashes."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "箭头/可选项/时序/状态与代码一致"
msgstr "Arrows/options/sequences/states match code."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "翻译"
msgstr "Translation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "源版本、缺译/fuzzy、状态"
msgstr "Source versions, missing/fuzzy messages and status."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "规范强度、单位和失败条件保持"
msgstr "Preserved normative strength, units and failure conditions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "交付"
msgstr "Delivery"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "manifest、相对链接、实际站点身份"
msgstr "Manifests, relative links and actual site identity."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "支持/计划/资格边界没有混淆"
msgstr "No confusion of support, plans or qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:172
msgid ""
"不通过正则扫描正文来自动判定“支持”或“安全”。新增gate行为采用实际负路径 TDD；纯正文和图源修改采用对应检查与语义评审，不新增镜像实现测试。"
msgstr ""
"Regex prose scanning never automatically decides “supported” or “safe”. New "
"gate behavior uses actual negative-path TDD. Prose/diagram-source changes "
"use applicable checks/semantic review without implementation-mirroring "
"tests."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:175
msgid ""
"审查记录至少绑定页面/图、代码与文档来源、发现、处理结果和退出条件。下列情况 必须修正后才能关闭相应任务：错误配置、借用提前回收、错误完成顺序、图中虚构"
" 模块、错误支持/HIL声明、断链、未标注的过期翻译、关键图无法阅读。"
msgstr ""
"Reviews bind pages/diagrams, code/docs sources, findings, resolution and "
"exit conditions. Correct these before closing tasks: invalid configurations,"
" early borrow reclamation, wrong completion order, invented modules, false "
"support/HIL, broken links, unmarked stale translations or unreadable "
"critical diagrams."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-standards.md:179
msgid ""
"完整标准应用和58项系统实施以台账实际状态为准。快速提交检查、严格文档CI、 "
"图源/输出配对和全部当前页面的中英文翻译检查由统一CLI执行。原文摘要、审查 标记和严格构建新提取的完整消息集合同时有效；缺译、过期或 fuzzy "
"必须修复。 混合语言原文可采用同源语言 catalog，代码、标识符和原证据值保持原样。 历史归档不参与当前翻译完成判定；独立语义、视觉、发布与恢复结果"
" 分别绑定实际输入，不从规则或工作流存在推断执行完成。"
msgstr ""
"Ledger state determines standard application and 58-item implementation "
"acceptance. Unified CLI runs offline commit checks, strict CI, source/output"
" pairing and English/Chinese checks for every current page. Source digests, "
"review markers and newly extracted complete strict-build message sets must "
"all agree; missing/stale/fuzzy translations fail. Mixed sources may use "
"source-language catalogs while code, identifiers and original evidence "
"remain unchanged. Archives do not count toward current translation "
"completion. Semantic, visual, publication and restoration records bind "
"actual inputs; rules/workflows alone never establish execution."
